WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.005 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Tazza ilma tidher ċara. Iżda oċean fond

2
00:00:03.005 --> 00:00:06.279 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
spiss jidher blu. Il-fond jagħmel differenza.

3
00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:11.066 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Id-dawl tax-xemx fih ħafna tulijiet ta’ mewġ.

4
00:00:11.066 --> 00:00:14.932 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
L-ilma jassorbi l-parti l-ħamra tal-ispettru aktar mill-blu.

5
00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:19.782 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Fl-ilma fond, aktar dawl aħmar jiġi assorbit.

6
00:00:19.782 --> 00:00:23.316 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Id-dawl li jasal lura f’għajnejna spiss ikun

7
00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:23.638 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
blu.

8
00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:27.510 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Il-plankton, is-sediment, il-fond u r-rifless tas-sema jbiddlu

9
00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:30.315 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
l-kulur. Għalhekk l-ilma qrib il-kosta jista’ jidher

10
00:00:30.315 --> 00:00:31.717 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
aħdar jew lewn it-turkważ.
